FOR EACH LOOPS

for-each loops exclusively loop the contents of an Array.

Syntax:
  foreach(data-type variable-name in array-name)
  {
    //code
  }

EX:

string[] icecreamsDevoured = {"Mint down in Beauverry St.", "Chocolate at Ricky's place.", "Cotton candy waffle cone at the abandoned cold storage depot."}

  foreach(string i in icecreamsDevoured)
  {
    Console.WriteLine(i);
  }

